  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "三类宿主容器",
      "items": [
        "AutoLayoutActivity 只识别 LinearLayout / FrameLayout / RelativeLayout 三个名字，其余交给 super.onCreateView",
        "AutoFrameLayout、AutoLinearLayout 在 onMeasure 里先 mHelper.adjustChildren() 再走系统测量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "缩放口径",
      "items": [
        "AutoLayoutConifg 从 manifest 的 design_width/design_height 读设计稿尺寸，再按屏幕宽高算出比例",
        "AutoAttr.apply 按 baseWidth/baseHeight 选宽或高比例，取 Math.max(val, 1) 防止细分割线变成 0"
      ]
    }
  ]
}